# The API loads environment from the monorepo root only (see packages/config — `.env` or `.env.local` there).
# Copy from ../../.env.example into ../../.env (pnpm bootstrap:env) and optional ../../.env.local for overrides.
#
# Required for local API (see root .env.example): DATABASE_URL, PLATFORM_API_SECRET, SESSION_SECRET,
# AUTH_TOKEN_SECRET, DASHBOARD_URL, DEPLOYMENT_SECRET_KEY.
#
# LICENSE_SIGNING_SECRET — 32+ characters; signs POS offline license JWTs. In development/test the API
# falls back to a built-in default if unset. Set explicitly to match production behavior.
# LICENSE_SIGNING_SECRET=
